a.indiatimes.com/india/log-out-of-whatsapp-web-on-shared-computers-to-avoid-misuse-govt/articleshow/136113691.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-24T01:54:32+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136113694,imgsize-26420.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SCO: Pakistan set to invite India for culture ministers' meeting]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sco-pakistan-set-to-invite-india-for-culture-ministers-meeting/articleshow/136113227.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136113227.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In an unexpected diplomatic turn, Pakistan is set to invite India for a culture ministers meeting next year, marking a notable engagement since the Pahalgam terrorist attack. Following this, Pakistan will also host the SCO heads of state council summit in August. Although PM Narendra Modi's attendance is unlikely, a senior minister may attend, contingent on the prevailing security environment that will heavily influence India’s diplomatic decisions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sco-pakistan-set-to-invite-india-for-culture-ministers-meeting/articleshow/136113227.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sco-pakistan-set-to-invite-india-for-culture-ministers-meeting/articleshow/136113227.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-24T00:47:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sachin Parashar</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136113281,imgsize-106450.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Coward government': CJP's Saurav Das says he was stopped from flying for  lecture at University of Oxford]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/coward-government-cjps-saurav-das-says-he-was-stopped-from-flying-for-lecture-at-university-of-oxford/articleshow/136112962.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136112962.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[CJP activist Saurav Das was allegedly barred from boarding a flight to London by the Indian government. He was set to deliver lectures at several prestigious universities including Oxford and Cambridge. Das expressed concerns that the government feared his views reaching international institutions. Fellow activists criticized the government's actions, highlighting a broader anti-intellectual stance. This incident follows a previous CJP campaign addressing various social issues in Goa.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/coward-government-cjps-saurav-das-says-he-was-stopped-from-flying-for-lecture-at-university-of-oxford/articleshow/136112962.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/coward-government-cjps-saurav-das-says-he-was-stopped-from-flying-for-lecture-at-university-of-oxford/articleshow/136112962.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-24T00:28:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136113093,imgsize-846443.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rail passenger traffic to cross pre-Covid level, touch 820 crore this fiscal]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rail-passenger-traffic-to-cross-pre-covid-level-touch-820-crore-this-fiscal/articleshow/136112649.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136112649.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rail-passenger-traffic-to-cross-pre-covid-level-touch-820-crore-this-fiscal/articleshow/136112649.cms]]></link><gu